    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase A2: External-lock contract tests for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_schema_version_manager" kindref="compound">SchemaVersionManager</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Test IDs: MCH-L01..MCH-L04</para>
</simplesect>
<ref refid="classthemis_1_1_schema_version_manager" kindref="compound">SchemaVersionManager</ref> is explicitly NOT thread-safe (documented contract). These tests verify the sequential API contract and documented error paths:</para>
<para>MCH-L01 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_version_result_1a7908a9bf68c3f1820703f0bfba218d3b" kindref="member">VersionResult&lt;T&gt;::failure()</ref> carries correct error code and message MCH-L02 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_version_result_1af8cad4e2e95e40c3a3809d11bc0d7495" kindref="member">VersionResult&lt;T&gt;::ok</ref> flag is false when constructed via failure() MCH-L03 <ref refid="namespacethemis_1afef9111c0d3096ecfeba427c19c9a328" kindref="member">VersionErrorCode</ref> values are distinct (TABLE_NOT_FOUND != VERSION_NOT_FOUND) MCH-L04 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_version_result_1a88eb0b4cc1007616aac0144fd431e1cc" kindref="member">VersionResult&lt;uint64_t&gt;::success()</ref> sets ok=true and preserves value</para>
<para>All tests are self-contained header-only; no RocksDB, no network I/O. Canonical PRNG seed: kLockContractSeed = 42 (declared; not required here).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="schema__version__manager_8h" kindref="compound">include/metadata/schema_version_manager.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/metadata/ROADMAP.md — Phase A external-lock contract </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
